window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Rika is mech-meat, a cyborg killing machine, created by the Genevian military and cast aside when the war was lost.</p> <p>This volume contains the first three novels of the Rika’s Marauders series:</p> <p></p> <ul> <li><i>Rika Outcast</i></li> <li><i>Rika Redeemed</i></li> <li><i>Rika Triumphant</i></li> </ul> <p>Embark on an epic journey with Rika as she goes from a young woman lost and alone to the leader of an elite special-forces team, ultimately becoming the commander of a company of mechanized warriors.</p> <p>Set in the Aeon 14 universe, this story is an excellent place to join the journey or a fantastic way to get your next Aeon 14 fix.</p>"; 
